## Why This Is Asked
Tests real-world expertise in diagnosing cross-region telemetry issues where timing accuracy can masquerade as latency problems.

## Key Concepts
- Time synchronization (PTP/NTP) across regions
- Hardware timestamping and NIC support
- Cross-region log correlation for telemetry
- Impact of clock skew on tail latency measurements

